    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "93 The Watermill, Raheny, Dublin 5, D05 E2P7 is a beautifully appointed two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment extending to approximately 90 sq. m., excluding its impressive south-facing balcony. Occupying the middle floor of Block 2, an intimate block of just three apartments, this is a particularly spacious and stylish home that has been completely refurbished and upgraded to an exceptional standard.\r\n\r\nThe current owners have invested considerably in transforming the apartment, and the quality of the finish is evident throughout. Beautiful timber flooring, carefully chosen finishes and a contemporary interior combine to create a home that feels both luxurious and comfortable. Presented in immaculate condition, it offers a genuine turnkey opportunity with no further expenditure required.\r\n\r\nA generous entrance hall immediately gives a sense of the space on offer and incorporates excellent storage together with a separate utility area housing the washing machine. The accommodation flows particularly well, separating the bedroom accommodation from the main living space.\r\nThe kitchen/living/dining room is undoubtedly one of the highlights of the apartment. Extending to approximately 7.79m in length, this is a wonderfully bright and generous open-plan room with ample space for comfortable seating, dining and entertaining. The fitted kitchen is neatly incorporated into the room, while extensive glazing brings plenty of natural light into the living area.\r\n\r\nFrom here, doors open directly onto the large south-facing balcony, measuring approximately 5.87m x 2.00m. This is a superb extension of the living space, with plenty of room for outdoor furniture and dining. Its sheltered aspect and sunny orientation make it an ideal spot to sit outside, entertain or simply enjoy the peaceful surroundings of the development.\r\n\r\nBoth bedrooms are generous doubles. The main bedroom benefits from a newly fitted en-suite, while the equally impressive main bathroom has also been completely renewed. Both bathrooms have a crisp, contemporary finish and form part of the extensive refurbishment carried out by the present owners.\r\n\r\nPractical features have been equally well considered. There are electric blinds throughout, a modern combi boiler providing instant hot water, excellent built-in storage, lift access and two designated car parking spaces. The apartment also benefits from a strong B3 BER rating, adding to its comfort and efficiency.\r\n\r\nThe Watermill itself is a mature and beautifully maintained residential development, particularly appealing for its peaceful atmosphere and attractive surroundings. Yet everything that makes Raheny such a popular place to live is close at hand. Raheny Village, DART services and local shops and cafés are within easy reach, while St Anne's Park, the seafront, Bull Island and Dollymount Strand provide an exceptional choice of parkland, coastal walks and outdoor amenities.\r\n\r\nNo. 93 combines the proportions of a much larger home with the convenience of apartment living. Its high-end refurbishment, excellent natural light, substantial south-facing balcony and peaceful setting make this an apartment that stands out from the norm, and the standard of finish really does need to be seen to be fully appreciated."
      },
